  <Lines>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d57cec67bb2a1a945ada3b66d3cb9bf5, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Ce qu\u2019il s\u2019est pass\xE9, c\u2019est que Marco a commenc\xE9 \xE0
      dire \xE0 tout le monde que j\u2019aurais \u201Csoudoy\xE9\u201D Ynna pour
      \xEAtre recrut\xE9e i\xE7i. "
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4db0d9531338cfe4ea4e57a3339c89c1, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d35d0e1530830e42b12a5e80d0329dc, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "C\u2019est ce que j\u2019ai entendu\u2026"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d57cec67bb2a1a945ada3b66d3cb9bf5, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Mais c\u2019est compl\xE8tement faux ! \r\n"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4db0d9531338cfe4ea4e57a3339c89c1, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Pourtant y a plein d\u2019indices ! "
    - "Et c\u2019\xE9tait pas une raison pour te jeter sur moi !"
